          "chunk_id": "s04_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_writing_guided_score_taylor_series",
          "text": "By writing the guided score as a Taylor series in the guidance strength around one, they recover CFG as the first-order case and then add a second-order term.",
